title: "ideal-cnt-cb-network: Stochastic ideal-network reference generator for CNT/CB polymer composites"
abstract: >-
  Parameter-driven Monte Carlo generator that computes the ideal-network
  percolation threshold, Simmons-weighted conductivity, and piezoresistive
  gauge-factor response of CNT/CB polymer composites, reporting each quantity as
  an ensemble mean with dispersion.
